            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'The table provides a detailed summary of employee interview results, specifically focusing on their feedback sentiment across two phases of interviews. It includes columns for the Employee ID, Employee Name, Position, Policy discussed (Health), Interview Phase (1st or 2nd), Interviewer Name, Interview Date, and the Sentiment Result (categorized as Unhappy, Neutral, or Happy). Additionally, the filters on the right allow users to search and refine the data by Employee ID, Name, or Sentiment Classification. '"
